          "line": 29,
          "upstream": "    5. **Discovery Service (DS)**: — A verified on-fabric application that enables discovery of catalogs only accessible via CNs. Its network-facing API MUST implement the Beckn Protocol API endpoints that receive catalog discovery requests from CNs and asynchronously respond with catalogs from various providers. It MUST ensure the catalog it has is the most recent, either by subscribing to updates from the fabric cataloging service (see next section — deprecated, see NFH-014) or by crawling and independently verifying PN-hosted catalog files per NFH-014's decentralized publishing model. It MAY be implemented as an independent SaaS for CNs to consume, or implemented by the CNs themselves.",
